    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108980/extras/4de8b11a889958603615f6f3b14b8398.poster.avif?t=1746623591\" width=800 height=457 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108980/extras/4de8b11a889958603615f6f3b14b8398.webm?t=1746623591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part-Time Witch</strong> is a potion-brewing simulator where you physically interact with your ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108980/extras/9351cd0e7b6d7d9676226215baf49acf.avif?t=1746623591\" width=616 height=88 /></span>You play as a young girl who dreams of becoming a professional witch and takes on a part-time job to make her dreams come true. Brew potions, get rich, unlock new ingredients, and always follow the recipe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108980/extras/7bf97ff66b4cca78b6d41bba2c36cfbe.avif?t=1746623591\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically-based potion-brewing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animated cutscenes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8 unique potion recipes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous interactions and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108980/extras/166ec501059a0ebfa5ef4344028d2274.poster.avif?t=1746623591\" ><source 